{"id":"n65098-1-8","stage":3,"title":"쌓이다 · 堆","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65098-1-8-1","ko":"책상에 왜 저렇게 많은 책이 쌓여 있니?","zh":"桌子上面为什么堆了那么多书啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상에","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책이","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌓여","meaning":"堆，叠放，堆积","explanation":"쌓이다：堆，叠放，堆积；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쌓이다","audio":"/audio/a3671bf3560526d3e4f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65098","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌓이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]